Date: Tue, 31 Jan 2023 22:40:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Support passing `MethodRouter` to `Router::fallback`

Fixes #1645

This implements `Handler` for `MethodRouter` which enables passing it to
`Router::fallback` even if the `MethodRouter` requires state.

This also enables doing `get(get(handler))` which is odd but I doubt
anyone would do that by accident. I'm not sure if it could lead to
